{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour on Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run along and up walls, swing on any bars or thin objects, slide, vault, get creative and break the game. Your speed and momentum translates to your moves - move and fall faster to climb and swing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No  perks to unlock, the only thing holding you back is creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/54d386c1e06548bc1ee81aeb9fe96b2a.poster.avif?t=1755299536\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/54d386c1e06548bc1ee81aeb9fe96b2a.webm?t=1755299536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/54d386c1e06548bc1ee81aeb9fe96b2a.mp4?t=1755299536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Rome</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has moved on and left Earth to robots, factories and creatures. Unfrozen, it is now your turn to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the remnants of Rome and dystopian factories. Meet the creatures that have adapted to survive and find a way off planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Linear Levels, Open Approaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are always multiple approaches to any problem. Whether you're an explorative new player or a style-obsessed veteran, you'll find a path that works for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/af49fda659d2925a67e81edf983081cb.poster.avif?t=1755299536\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/af49fda659d2925a67e81edf983081cb.webm?t=1755299536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/extras/af49fda659d2925a67e81edf983081cb.mp4?t=1755299536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painterly art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic post-rock soundtrack that rewards you for being stylish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game tutorial and videos to help familiarise yourself with the movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 1st-person and to be motion sick friendly.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676250?t=1755299536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676250?t=1755299536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/ffe6f0f7e26d849bf8f8bb621835dffdee6ef031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755299536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676250/ffe6f0f7e26d849bf8f8bb621835dffdee6ef031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755299536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour on Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run along and up walls, swing on any bars or thin objects, slide, vault, get creative and break the game. Your speed and momentum translates to your moves - move and fall faster to climb and swing further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No  perks to unlock, the only thing holding you back is creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"